# Corners: the lowest and highest notes, top notes at the 11 kHz pitch cap (the 4' is gone there), the knobs at
# their ends, full bends, velocity 1 and 127, on the lead track.
tempo 120
steps 24
tail 1.5
track lead
param attack 0
param sustain 255
param release 30
param p1 0
param p2 0
note 0 C0 2 127
note 0 C8 2 127
param p1 255 2
param p2 255 2
note 2 C0 2 127
note 2 G9 2 127
note 4 C-1 2 1
note 4 G9 2 1
param p1 128 6
param p2 76 6
note 6 C4 6 127
bend 7 200
bend 9 -200
bend 11 0
note 12 B6 4 127
note 12 Gb7 4 127
sweep p1 0 255 12 16
sweep p2 255 0 12 16
note 16 C5 8 127
param p2 255 16
sweep p1 255 0 16 24
expect sound 0 24
expect idle 40
expect peak_below -4
